A||||17||88 Database Guy||The '88 Database Needs Your Help!||||7||
Z||000000||88 Database Guy||07-24-2000||12:53 PM||||Dear Forum Members,  <P>It's been some time since I posted here, and I wanted to ask again for help in this project.  For those who haven't heard, I'm trying to put together a registry for all 1988 Fieros.  So far, we've got info on 1135 cars out of the 26402 made in 1988.  That's too many to list them here, but if anyone would like a summary of them, please email me at the NEW email below.<P>Basically, I'm trying to get a head count, so don't require more than the VIN of a car to enter it into the database.  I would LIKE to get as much info as possible, especially the factory colors (Outside, Inside, and Rims for GTs) and transmission option, and the status of the car (Dead or Alive!), but will be very happy to get any info that you might care to send.  Since this is a car registry and not an owners registry (there are some good ones out there already), you can omit any personal info if you choose, and I will enter your car with no other info than the VIN and options that you send to me.  <P>Also, if those going to the FOCOA nationals could help, I'd love to get a list of the '88s that show up there.  I'm down in Savannah GA and can't make it up there, so any help would be terrific.<P>Thanks for reading, let me know if you want a list of the current registry,<P>John Willhoff  john.willhoff@gulfaero.com<BR>(965) 898-1389<BR>||||reg||7
Z||000001||b lo 0||07-24-2000||01:00 PM||||Hey  John!  You won't recognize my handle here, but I'm the guy (Gregman) who's been emailing you back and forth about my '85 GT.  It's good to see you in the forum!  If I had an '88 I'd help you out, but I don't.  Well, thanks for telling me about the Pennock BB, it's been greatly helpful.<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>GAWD I love this car||||reg||10
Z||000002||88 Database Guy||07-24-2000||01:09 PM||||Hey Gregman,<P>You're right, I wouldn't have recognized ya!  Glad to see you here, and that you've found some answers to your questions here.  Everyone here is really great, and the only reason I haven't posted much lately is that I changed jobs, so, I'll Be Back more often now.<P>You going to the meeting this weekend and the American Pie?  I'm going to try to, hope you can make it.<BR>||||reg||1
